<para>The first invariant of the stress tensor <formula id="190">$ \boldsymbol{\sigma} $</formula> is the trace:    <formula id="191">\[  I_1 = \operatorname{tr}(\boldsymbol{\sigma})
      = \sigma_{11} + \sigma_{22} + \sigma_{33}
\]</formula> <parameterlist kind="templateparam"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>T</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Scalar type (e.g., double, float). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>stress</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>6-component stress vector in Voigt notation:    <formula id="192">$ \boldsymbol{\sigma}^{\text{Voigt}} =
    \begin{bmatrix}
      \sigma_{11} &amp; \sigma_{22} &amp; \sigma_{33} &amp; \sigma_{12} &amp; \sigma_{13} &amp; \sigma_{23}
    \end{bmatrix}^T $</formula> </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>Value of the first invariant <formula id="189">$ I_1 $</formula>. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
