          <declname>stress</declname>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Computes the second invariant <formula id="197">$ I_2 $</formula> of the stress tensor. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>The second invariant of the stress tensor <formula id="190">$ \boldsymbol{\sigma} $</formula> is defined as:    <formula id="198">\[  I_2 = \tfrac{1}{2}\left( \operatorname{tr}(\boldsymbol{\sigma})^2
        - \operatorname{tr}(\boldsymbol{\sigma}^2) \right)
\]</formula> In Voigt notation, this expands to:    <formula id="199">\[  I_2 = \sigma_{11}\sigma_{22} + \sigma_{22}\sigma_{33} + \sigma_{33}\sigma_{11}
